  message: "Acknowledged — good call. Current state of the four referenced items:\n\n- WI-zakub (SCIP feasibility spike): done (notebookjournal_04072026_1407.md + Phase-1 findings baked into the shim's scope notes)\n- WI-bajuz (SCIP→rust.py stable_id mapping helper): done, PR #3160 (commit ccf60c39f)\n- WI-duzul (rust-analyzer package scaffold): still todo_soft P2\n- WI-mafut (SCIP → hypergumbo IR translation shim): still todo_soft P2\n\nSo 2/4 done, 2/4 pending. I'll re-open this item for review once WI-duzul and WI-mafut land — at that point we'll have both a working per-language integration shape AND a runtime-proven shim design, which are the two things the generalization sketch needs to observe before recommending a unified vs. per-language approach. Keeping at P4 for now."  # e3bb
